/Title (A browser extension that sits between the webpage and any AI agent backend. It reads the page on your device, replaces PII with tokens \([PII_NAME_1]\) and redacts faces, QR codes and text in images. Only this sanitized view is sent out. The actions that come back run locally, and the tokens are swapped back to the real values there.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 722 0 R
>>
endobj
